Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.82,0:00:04.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伟大的发明
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.77,0:00:09.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Welcome, everybody! Welcome to Amazing Discoveries!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.77,0:00:09.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欢迎各位收看"伟大的发明"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:11.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, oh! It's on again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又播出了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guys, could we please not watch this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}同志们  能别看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.59,0:00:16.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Folks, has this ever happened to you? 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.59,0:00:16.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是否遇过这种情形
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:18.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You go to the refrigerator to get a nice glass of milk, 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:18.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你正打算去冰箱拿一杯牛奶...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.32,0:00:21.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and these cartons are so flinging, flanging hard to open!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.32,0:00:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但却打不开纸盒子  
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:23.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you said it, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:23.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  你说对了  麦克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:29.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Aw! There's gotta be a better way. - And there is, Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:29.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-一定得有更好的办法  -的确有  凯文
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.37,0:00:33.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Can we please turn this off? - No way, Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.37,0:00:33.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-能关掉吗  -不行  凯文
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:37.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There is a revolutionary new product that guarantees...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:37.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有个新产品能保证...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:40.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... you'll never have to open up milk cartons again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:40.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你再也不用费力打开牛奶纸盒呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:43.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meet the Milkmaster 2000!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:43.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请看牛奶大师2000
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.97,0:00:46.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you intrigued? 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.97,0:00:46.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你感兴趣了吧 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:48.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're flinging, flanging right I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:48.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  说得我心痒痒的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.99,0:00:51.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Keep in mind, he's never used this product before, 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.99,0:00:51.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记住  这是他第一次使用  
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:53.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you'll see how easy this is to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:53.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可见这玩意用起来有多容易
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:57.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Go ahead, this works in any milk carton. - Wow, it is easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:57.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-任何牛奶纸盒都适用  -真简单!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.87,0:01:00.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now I can have milk every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.87,0:01:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样我就可以天天喝牛奶了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.15,0:01:06.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》第三季第四集  所谓的隧道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:05.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Perhaps, you would like me to turn like this, 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:05.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你希望我转过去 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.43,0:02:07.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so you can bunny-bump against my back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.43,0:02:07.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样就能靠在我背上亲热了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:12.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, man. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:12.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.14,0:02:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe you can tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.14,0:02:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许该由你来告诉我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:15.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My agent would want to know 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:15.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的经纪人问我  
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:18.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}why I didn't show up at the audition I didn't know I had today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:18.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天为何没有参加我根本不知道的试镜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.05,0:02:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The first good thing she gets me in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.05,0:02:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这几周来她为我争取到的第一个好机会 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:21.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How could you not give me the message?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:21.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么没转告我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:23.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll tell you, I do enjoy guilt...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:23.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉你  我虽然喜欢恶作剧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:27.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... but it wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但不是我干的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.16,0:02:28.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, it was. It was him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.16,0:02:28.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的  就是他干的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:32.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, it was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:32.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  是我干的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How was it you? 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么会是你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.32,0:02:37.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it was this, it was all so crazy, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.32,0:02:37.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为当时情况紧急  你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.62,0:02:40.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, Chandler was in the closet, counting to 10...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.62,0:02:40.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德在小房间里  倒数十秒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:43.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and he was up to 7 and I hadn't found a place to hide yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:43.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已经数到七了  可我一直找不到地方躲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.67,0:02:47.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I meant to tell you, and I wrote it all down on my hand. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.67,0:02:47.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我本想告诉你个  都写在手上了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:48.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See? All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:48.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看  全都在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:50.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yep, that's my audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:50.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  就是我的试镜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:54.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See? Now, this is why I keep notepads everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:54.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧  这就是我到处放便条纸的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.59,0:02:56.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yep. And that's why we don't invite you to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.59,0:02:56.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  所以我们从不叫你一起玩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.71,0:03:01.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is the great tragedy here? 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.71,0:03:01.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这有什么了不起的  
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.02,0:03:02.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You go get yourself another appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.02,0:03:02.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再约个时间呗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:04.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, Estelle tried, you know. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:04.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾丝特尔试过了  
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.34,0:03:06.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The casting director told her I missed my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.34,0:03:06.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}导演说我已经错过了机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:07.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that is unfair!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:07.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样太不公平了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:10.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll call her and I'll tell her it was totally my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来打给她  告诉她都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:12.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pheebes, you can't do that. The casting director doesn't 
