Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.87,0:03:14.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}talk to friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.87,0:03:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟演员的朋友谈的
