Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:19.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.08,0:03:23.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What are you doing? - No, I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.08,0:03:23.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在做什么  -我心里有数
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:28.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, this is Caitlin from Phoebe Buffay's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:28.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是菲比·布菲公司的凯特琳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:32.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is Anne there for Phoebe?
