Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:42.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着  乔伊·崔比安尼遇到了点小问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:43.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently, he missed his audition. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:43.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很显然  他错过了试演   
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:45.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who did you speak to in my office?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:45.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请问你转告了我们公司的哪一位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:48.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Estelle? I don't know what to do with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:48.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾丝特尔  我真不知该拿她怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:51.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, so your husband leaves and burns down the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:51.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就算她丈夫离她而去  还放火烧了房子   
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:52.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The world doesn't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:52.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没了她  地球照转
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is anybody else scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有谁觉得毛骨悚然
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:03:59.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right, well look, if Joey loses this audition, 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:03:59.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果乔伊错过了这次试镜  
