Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:01.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我就开了艾丝特尔  我管不了那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:03.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Annie, you are a doll. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:03.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}安妮  你真善良  
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:06.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What time can you see him? I need a pen. Pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:06.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你何时能见他  给我一支笔  笔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:15.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get the woman a pad! Get the woman a pad! A pad! A pad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:15.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快给这女人弄张便条  给她张便条  便条
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.10,0:04:19.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, now you want a pad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.10,0:04:19.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你现在需要便条了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:26.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's my boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:26.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的小伙子来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:28.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:28.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的小伙子在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And here's his Barbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有他的芭比娃娃
