Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.69,0:04:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他自己在玩具店选的  他很喜欢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:44.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He carries it everywhere, 
